{"thought": "The proposal card is drafted; now I tell Bob what it says, read back his no-Mondays/nothing-before-10 hard lines, and state what I took from his ask.", "tool": "tell_bob", "args": {"text": "Your Telegram note is now on the plan as two hard lines: no Mondays and nothing before 10:00. I read your ask as 45 minutes on a Meet link to go through the partnership numbers, any time in the two weeks starting tomorrow.

Remy Calloway hasn't written yet, so I went straight to your calendar and picked three open times that clear both lines: Tuesday the 10th at 3:15pm, Thursday the 12th at 10:00am, and Friday the 13th at 10:00am.

The card as drafted is a note to Remy Calloway with you in cc, offering those three times with a line that it's 45 minutes on a Meet link for the partnership numbers. It's the first thing from me on this thread, so it introduces me and signs off as your assistant agent. Approve sends it."}}
